# ES8311 codec driver tests

Exercises the ES8311 driver's register transcript and playback against a
recording MCU platform that answers as the codec does: the reset and power-up
sequence, the output-channel program for I2S playback, the sixteen-bit
little-endian frames play ships down the I2S link, the invalid-wiring refusals,
and the lifecycle. No hardware is involved.
